  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nPure Pale was inspired by the softness, innocence, and delicate atmosphere of childhood. This creates soft, airy tones with a pale green-blue hue. It works beautifully for photos taken in bright, naturally lit interiors, as well as cafes and parks during outings, adding a gentle touch to everyday memories. For a more translucent, airy look, try using it in softly shaded spots with sunlight filtering through the trees rather than in direct sunlight.",
